**sample.cpp maps battery_state statuses to stable strings.**

## Interface

`to_string(battery_state::status s) noexcept -> const char*` returns `"unknown"`, `"discharging"`, `"charging"`, or `"full"`; unknown values fall back to `"unknown"`.